  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Relaunch of the financing initiative for SMEs in MENA - C4IF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The third component of the &#x201c;Youth Employment and Entrepreneurship&#x201d; part of the Danish Arab 
Partnership Program is designed to foster growth and job creation by providing access to finance 
to small &amp; medium-sized enterprises (SMEs), by facilitating the inflow of private sector capital, 
initially through the Sharaka Capital Fund.</narrative>
  </description>
